          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A spike in attacks on commercial shipping delays and diverts shipments of GPUs, networking and server hardware, forcing postponement of planned data-center builds and short-term reductions in available compute infrastructure capacity." />
