          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained drawdowns and diversion of Western military stocks to support Ukraine create immediate supply and prioritization pressures that produce differing burden-sharing responses and timetables among Asian partners, eroding short-term policy alignment within the alliance." />
