          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising private and public investment into dual-use AI firms increases production, inventories and rapid commercial-to-government procurement of ISR, autonomous loitering munitions and related systems that can be purchased or donated to parties in the conflict." />
