          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rapid rise in AI-directed capital flows into defense contractors and integrators accelerates procurement and fielding schedules for AI-enabled systems, creating immediate interoperability and command-and-control integration needs that allies meet by increasing the scale and frequency of joint exercises." />
