          <attvalue for="36" value="Higher capex for AI hardware expands production capacity for AI-specific chips and edge compute modules, lowering unit costs and increasing availability of high-performance autopilot and vision stacks that flow into commercial and gray-market drone manufacturers used in the Russia-Ukraine theater." />
